Package: rcpmcp
Type: Package
Title: Regional Consistency Probability under Multiple Comparison Procedures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given  = "Gosuke",
    family = "Homma",
    role   = c("aut", "cre"),
    email  = "my.name.is.gosuke@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Computes regional consistency probabilities (RCPs) and disjunctive
    power for multi-regional clinical trials (MRCTs) with multiple primary
    endpoints under multiplicity adjustment procedures. Implements closed-form
    solutions based on the multivariate normal distribution and Monte Carlo
    simulation for the Bonferroni, Holm, Hochberg, and Hommel procedures.
    Provides adjusted consistency thresholds for both Method 1 and Method 2
    of the Japanese Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare (MHLW) guidance
    that correct for null RCP inflation arising from Bonferroni-adjusted
    critical values. Sample size determination under the Bonferroni procedure
    is also supported.
